sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as Job Executor (Ansible)
    participant Up as upstream_translation_update.sh
    participant Pr as propose_translation_update.sh
    participant Lib as common_translation_update.sh
    participant API as External (Zanata/Gerrit)

    Note over Job, API: [Export] Extract and Upload New English Strings (Upstream)
    
    Job->>Up: Execute script
    Up->>Lib: source common_translation_update.sh
    Lib-->>Up: Load common functions & env variables
    
    Up->>Lib: Call setup_logging()
    Up->>Lib: Call check_params() (Validate API Key, Project name)
    
    Up->>Lib: Call extract_messages()
    Note right of Lib: Generate .pot via pybabel extract
    
    Up->>Lib: Call upload_pot_to_zanata()
    Lib->>API: zanata-cli push (HTTP API)
    Note left of API: Register English source in Zanata

    Note over Job, API: [Import] Import Translations & Propose to Gerrit (Propose)

    Job->>Pr: Execute script
    Pr->>Lib: source common_translation_update.sh
    
    Pr->>Lib: Call download_po_from_zanata()
    Lib->>API: zanata-cli pull (HTTP API)
    Note left of API: Download .po files
    
    Pr->>Lib: Call process_translations()
    Note right of Lib: Organize and merge translation files
    
    Pr->>Lib: Call submit_to_gerrit()
    Lib->>API: git review (Gerrit API)
    Note left of API: Register changes as Translation Update Topic

    Note over Job, API: [Common] Cleanup Phase
    Job->>Lib: Call finish()
    Note right of Lib: Remove temp directories & Print summary
